  "design": {
    "idea": "Inside the glowing Rib-Cage Bilge: clear two Brine Lampreys, rotate the grounded schooner mirror-raft at low exhale, raise the heartbeat tide to float it onto the beam plane, and bank a blue bolt into the Esophagus Valve (opening the Gullet & lighting the escape portal to r1).",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "sho",
    "teaches": "Using belly_tide to ground a Tide Raft mirror for rotation, then floating it to reflect across acid bilge.",
    "decisions": 6,
    "expert_s": 52,
    "reward": "belly_hub+escape_portal+esophagus_open",
    "why": "Atmospheric organic belly hub teasing the Blowhole Arch above and grounding Wick inside the whale.",
